### ============ SAVED VEHICLES ============

### 1. Save a vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Unsave a vehicle
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Get my saved vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get my saved vehicles (cu paginare)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Check if vehicle is saved
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles/check/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============ ERROR CASES ============

### 6. Save vehicle inexistent (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Save acelasi vehicle de 2 ori (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Fara token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/saved-vehicles

###